### Transactions & Card Summary — example requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@cardId = PASTE_A_REAL_CARD_ID_HERE

### List all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List transactions filtered by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?category=Dining
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get one transaction (for status polling after a payment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/PASTE_TXN_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Card summary — balance, points, category breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/cards/{{cardId}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
